{"version":1,"content":"<p>張家輝與鍾雪瑩首度合作的電影《我阿爹想旅行》前日上映，截至今日（17日）下午，票房已突破450萬元。</p><p>兩人今日出席謝票活動，與團隊一同合十感謝觀眾支持。</p><p>鍾雪瑩欣喜見到不少家庭入場，張家輝則留意到有觀眾觀影後仍在拭淚。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T11:58:56.843095+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T11:24:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:17:34.524814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T11:57:34.711609+00:00","content_hash":"6992007bfacea1152b0a326cf14ccc173b8f0c69c6efe034cb2f79d5ad17cb17","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}